SUMMARY:NetSec Policy Workshop: Security Beyond the State
DESCRIPTION:A two-day NetSec Working Group 2 policy workshop and policy brief\, Security Beyond the State: Managing and Countering Transnational Threats and Vulnerabilities\, with a focus on the Mediterranean. Three pillars: transnational actors and networks\, hybrid and technology-enabled security challenges\, and energy and supply chain security.\n\nApplications close on 18 December 2026. Send the application form and a CV to Pavlos Koktsidis (pkoktsid@act.edu) and Carmen Márquez Carrasco (cmarque@us.es).\n\nFull details: https://netsec-cost.eu/policy-workshop-2027.html
LOCATION:Universidad de Sevilla\, Seville\, Spain
URL;VALUE=URI:https://netsec-cost.eu/policy-workshop-2027.html
CATEGORIES:Policy workshop,NetSec
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
